{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e0212b2c-5efa-8757-a94a-b8a5f3ea8802",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T13:42:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Yes, I am calling about water in the street. Is it okay, I am on speaker, my hands are busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Where is the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By my shop, 467 Ruggles Avenue, in Historic Hill. After the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. It is Monday now and still the water sits there. It is not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four six seven Ruggles Avenue. And where exactly is it pooling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Across the crosswalk, near the school bus stop. The water is wide, so the children, they step out into the road to go around it. [line breaks up] I am afraid a car will come. This happens every time it rains hard, and nobody comes to fix."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, the line broke up on me. The children are stepping into the road to avoid the water at the crosswalk by the bus stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly. And one more thing. There is a manhole cover, it looks off by one inch. Not sitting flat. Maybe the water pushed it, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm writing that down. A manhole cover that looks about an inch off, same area, near the crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same area, yes. Please, somebody should look at it before the children are there again. Tomorrow morning is school. [pause] Do the crews work on weekends? Because this is the second time I call about this street, and I wait and wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do have crews out when there's a lot to handle after a storm, but I can't tell you when they'll reach this one. I'll mark it as a safety issue because of the bus stop. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight oh. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Abdi. A-I-S-H-A, A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Abdi. I'll send it over today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Oh, and sorry, I am a little cheerful, even with this problem. I just found a new tea, a new brand, and I love it. I drank three cups this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, enjoy it. We'll get this passed along. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
